{"4783870":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Mythopolis","steam_appid":4783870,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5307730],"detailed_description":"Four mythologies share one board: the temples of Greece, the frozen north, the sands of Egypt and the lantern-lit gardens of Japan. Roll, move, and take what each land offers. Four medallions win the game, and every one of them is for sale — if you can afford it before somebody else does, and if you can hold on to it once you have.<br><br>You will not hold on to it quietly. Every player carries a hand of cards drawn from the myths themselves, and most of them are aimed at somebody. Steal a medallion, drag a rival across the board, empty their purse at an auction. The player you hit gets to answer: raise a shield, turn the spell back on its caster, or take it and plan something worse. Play online with up to seven friends, or against bots that scheme, bluff and hold grudges.<br><br><strong>Features<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer for four to eight players, through Steam — no accounts, no port forwarding<br><\/li><li>Play solo or fill empty seats with bots that come in four temperaments: aggressive, cautious, greedy and gambling<br><\/li><li>Four mythological regions on one board, each with its own tiles, cards and hazards<br><\/li><li>Dozens of cards that attack, defend, steal, teleport and reverse the turn order<br><\/li><li>Live auctions when a medallion goes to the highest bidder<br><\/li><li>Thirty-one characters to play as, each with a name of their own, and four board themes to play on<br><\/li><li>Fully translated into 15 languages — plus a few nobody asked for, including Latin and Elvish<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"Four mythologies share one board: the temples of Greece, the frozen north, the sands of Egypt and the lantern-lit gardens of Japan. Roll, move, and take what each land offers. Four medallions win the game, and every one of them is for sale — if you can afford it before somebody else does, and if you can hold on to it once you have.<br><br>You will not hold on to it quietly. Every player carries a hand of cards drawn from the myths themselves, and most of them are aimed at somebody. Steal a medallion, drag a rival across the board, empty their purse at an auction. The player you hit gets to answer: raise a shield, turn the spell back on its caster, or take it and plan something worse. Play online with up to seven friends, or against bots that scheme, bluff and hold grudges.<br><br><strong>Features<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online multiplayer for four to eight players, through Steam — no accounts, no port forwarding<br><\/li><li>Play solo or fill empty seats with bots that come in four temperaments: aggressive, cautious, greedy and gambling<br><\/li><li>Four mythological regions on one board, each with its own tiles, cards and hazards<br><\/li><li>Dozens of cards that attack, defend, steal, teleport and reverse the turn order<br><\/li><li>Live auctions when a medallion goes to the highest bidder<br><\/li><li>Thirty-one characters to play as, each with a name of their own, and four board themes to play on<br><\/li><li>Fully translated into 15 languages — plus a few nobody asked for, including Latin and Elvish<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Mythopolis is an online board game for four to eight players. Race across four mythologies, buy the medallions that win the game, and swing your rivals' fortunes with a hand of mythic cards — or lose everything to a single one.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Hindi, Quechua, Mongolian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4783870\/77c174ca19f462701f9416bd5546c9aca56745ae\/header.jpg?t=1793690913","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4783870\/3ea7fa39d0e226671e40c7a103a0450b412cf9fa\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793690913","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4783870\/3ea7fa39d0e226671e40c7a103a0450b412cf9fa\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793690913","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> \tWindows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent (64-bit, dual core)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.2 compatible GPU (GeForce GTX 750 \/ Radeon R7 260 \/ Intel HD 620 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core CPU, 3.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any dedicated Vulkan-compatible GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 Ridvan Dursun. All rights reserved.<br \/>\r\n","developers":["Ridvan Dursun"],"publishers":["Ridvan Dursun"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":899,"final":539,"discount_percent":40,"initial_formatted":"$8.99","final_formatted":"$5.39"},